OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after police
OL,4,Astand-off in Perth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fsix-hour stand-off with emergency
OL,8,Fservices in Perth.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the corner of
OL,11,FAtholl Street and North Methven Street
OL,12,Fat about 17:30 on Wednesday to reports
OL,13,Fof items being thrown from the window
OL,14,Fof an upper-floor flat.
OL,16,FRiot officers entered a flat shortly
OL,17,Fbefore midnight and arrested a
OL,18,F56-year-old man.
OL,20,FHe was charged in connection with the
OL,21,Fincident and is due to appear at Dundee
OL,22,FSheriff Court later.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
